      "name": "samld",
      "version": "size202528964-19eed9ca",
      "provenance": "file:C:\\Users\\bhara\\Downloads\\Laundering Data\\SAML-D.csv.zip",
      "label_definition": "positive = the account is the sender or the receiver of at least one transaction whose published Is_laundering flag is 1. SAML-D labels transactions; this entity label is derived, and it makes a launderer's counterparty positive as well",
      "synthetic": true,
      "notes": [
        "SAML-D is generated from declared typologies. Results on it are evidence about a simulator, not about real-world detection.",
        "Amounts are native across 13 currencies (95.7% GBP) and are not FX-converted; the amount column is 'amount', not 'amount_usd'.",
        "The published Laundering_type column is an exact alias of the label and is not loaded.",
        "Version is derived from file size and mtime, not a content hash."
      ]
